</section>

<section class="act">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv">
      <span class="k mono">\ The activation · More In Store</span>
      <h2>Meet them where they <span class="serif">are.</span></h2>
      <p class="sub">Most of this campaign happened in person. A mock-retail space that traveled Idaho, turned a heavy subject into a place teens chose to walk into, and earned a real conversation once they did.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="scenes">
