</section>

<div class="break posterbreak">
  <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="plx" src={`${G}/bq-poster-wall.jpg`} alt="The Buck the Quo poster system wheatpasted on a wall: Crush It, Raw Potential, Guts and Grit, No Fear No Doubt No Limits">
